~ start
# DEV TEST: toggle conversation sprites beside the party. Delete with the rest of the test (2.151).
do stage_party("Anton", "pg1")
=> menu

~ menu
Which sprite?
- Anton sprites
	=> anton_menu
- Jayce sprites
	=> jayce_menu
- Fiona and Layla, for scale
	Player: (Test) Fiona, for scale.
	if Flags.get_level_flag("party_companion_staged") == true:
		Layla: (Test) And Layla.
	=> menu
- Done [Leave]
	=> END

~ anton_menu
Which Anton sprite?
- pg_1
	do actor_change("Anton", "pg1")
	Anton: (Test) Anton: pg_1.
	=> anton_menu
- pg_2
	do actor_change("Anton", "pg2")
	Anton: (Test) Anton: pg_2.
	=> anton_menu
- pg_3
	do actor_change("Anton", "pg3")
	Anton: (Test) Anton: pg_3.
	=> anton_menu
- pg_4
	do actor_change("Anton", "pg4")
	Anton: (Test) Anton: pg_4.
	=> anton_menu
- BIG HEAD
	do actor_change("Anton", "anton_bighead")
	Anton: (Test) Anton: BIG HEAD.
	=> anton_menu
- WIDE
	do actor_change("Anton", "anton_wide")
	Anton: (Test) Anton: WIDE.
	=> anton_menu
- Back [Back]
	=> menu

~ jayce_menu
Which Jayce sprite?
- Current sprite
	do actor_change("Anton", "jayce_current")
	Anton: (Test) Jayce: current.
	=> jayce_menu
- BIG HEAD
	do actor_change("Anton", "jayce_bighead")
	Anton: (Test) Jayce: BIG HEAD.
	=> jayce_menu
- WIDE
	do actor_change("Anton", "jayce_wide")
	Anton: (Test) Jayce: WIDE.
	=> jayce_menu
- Back [Back]
	=> menu
